 ("p", "Process began in 2015; expert committee under **Dr K. Kasturirangan** in 2017; consultation with 2.5 lakh Gram Panchayats, 6600 blocks, 6000 urban local bodies and 676 districts; about 2 lakh suggestions; Union Cabinet approval in **July 2020**."),
 ("h2", "Policy, Programmes and Schemes"),
